{"seq":2,"slug":"case-control","title":"病例对照研究","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/study-design/case-control","wordCount":1763,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"病例对照研究\">病例对照研究</h1><p>假如一种癌症十万人里才几例，要用队列研究等它发生，得追踪几十万人随访十几年——成本高到不可行。病例对照研究反其道而行：不等结局发生，而是直接找来已经患病的人（病例）和没患病的人（对照），回头比较两组过去的暴露经历。它从「结局」倒推「暴露」，逆着时间箭头走。正是这种倒推，让它成为研究罕见病、罕见结局的利器，也让它背负了比队列研究更重的偏倚风险。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>病例对照研究的设计逻辑是「按结局分组、回顾暴露」。先按是否患目标病把人分成病例组与对照组，再分别调查两组在过去的暴露比例，若病例组暴露比例显著高于对照组，提示暴露与疾病可能相关。因为分组依据是结局而非暴露，它无法直接计算发病率，只能用比值比来逼近相对危险度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[确定研究人群] --&gt; B{按结局分组}&#10;    B --&gt;|病例组 患病| C[回顾过去暴露]&#10;    B --&gt;|对照组 未患病| D[回顾过去暴露]&#10;    C --&gt; E[病例暴露比例]&#10;    D --&gt; F[对照暴露比例]&#10;    E --&gt; G[构建四格表]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[计算 OR=ad/bc]\">flowchart TD\n    A[确定研究人群] --&gt; B{按结局分组}\n    B --&gt;|病例组 患病| C[回顾过去暴露]\n    B --&gt;|对照组 未患病| D[回顾过去暴露]\n    C --&gt; E[病例暴露比例]\n    D --&gt; F[对照暴露比例]\n    E --&gt; G[构建四格表]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[计算 OR=ad/bc]</pre><p>与 <a href=\"cohort-studies\">队列研究</a> 对照，二者像一枚硬币的两面：队列从因到果、可算发病率但怕罕见结局；病例对照从果到因、省时省钱但怕回忆与选择偏倚。下表把核心差异并列。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>队列研究</th>\n<th>病例对照研究</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分组依据</td>\n<td>暴露</td>\n<td>结局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间方向</td>\n<td>前瞻为主</td>\n<td>回顾</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直接产出</td>\n<td>发病率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>比值比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>罕见结局</td>\n<td>不适合</td>\n<td>适合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>罕见暴露</td>\n<td>适合</td>\n<td>不适合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要偏倚</td>\n<td>失访</td>\n<td>回忆、选择</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"比值比-为何能逼近相对危险度\">比值比：为何能逼近相对危险度</h2><p>病例对照研究算不出发病率，因为研究者人为决定了纳入多少病例、多少对照，分母是设计出来的而非人群真实比例。它的关联度量是比值比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>。在四格表中，病例组暴露 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 人、未暴露 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 人，对照组暴露 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 人、未暴露 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 人，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR = \\dfrac{a/c}{b/d} = \\dfrac{ad}{bc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>举例：病例组 100 人中 60 人曾暴露，对照组 100 人中 30 人曾暴露，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>70</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>4200</mn><mn>1200</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mn>3.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR = \\dfrac{60 \\times 70}{40 \\times 30} = \\dfrac{4200}{1200} = 3.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0908em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1200</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4200</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.5</span></span></span></span></span>。关键问题是这个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 凭什么能代表 <a href=\"cohort-studies\">队列研究</a> 里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>。答案是「罕见病假设」：当目标疾病在人群中足够罕见时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\ll b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c \\ll d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 在数学上趋近于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>。这正是病例对照研究最适合罕见病的深层原因——既是它的适用条件，也是它估计量合法性的前提。若疾病并不罕见，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 会系统性地高估 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，解读时必须明确点出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对照选择-最难也最关键的一步\">对照选择：最难也最关键的一步</h2><p>病例对照研究的成败，七分系于对照怎么选。一条铁律来自现代设计理念：对照应当代表「产生这些病例的源人群」中未患病的部分——也就是说，如果对照组里某人将来患了病，他应当有资格成为本研究的病例。违背这条原则，就会引入选择偏倚。常见对照来源各有利弊：医院对照取样方便、配合度高，但住院者本身可能因其他病而暴露异常（伯克森偏倚）；社区对照代表性好，但应答率低、成本高。</p>\n<p>为提高效率和控制混杂，常用匹配（matching）：让对照在年龄、性别等强混杂因素上与病例相似。匹配能在小样本时提升精度，但有代价——匹配过的因素无法再研究其效应，且必须用条件 logistic 回归等配对分析，否则会低估 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>。还有「过度匹配」之险：若不慎按中介或与暴露强相关的因素匹配，会把真效应抹掉。匹配与混杂控制的边界，与 <a href=\"../bias-effects/bias-confounding\">偏倚与混杂</a> 中的讨论直接衔接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"偏倚的高发地带\">偏倚的高发地带</h2><p>病例对照研究因其回顾性质，是各类偏倚的高发区。回忆偏倚最为典型：患病者会比健康者更卖力地回想过去的暴露，畸形儿的母亲对孕期用药的回忆远比正常产妇细致，于是制造出虚假关联。应对手段包括用客观记录（病历、处方数据库）替代自述、设盲、选用同样患病但患的是无关疾病的对照来平衡回忆动机。</p>\n<p>选择偏倚则潜伏在病例与对照的入选过程里。若病例只取住院的重症、对照取门诊的轻症，两组的暴露分布就被入院机制扭曲。无应答偏倚同样常见——愿意参加研究的人往往在暴露或健康意识上不同于拒绝者。这些偏倚的识别与方向判断是 <a href=\"../bias-effects/bias-confounding\">偏倚与混杂</a> 的核心内容，此处要确立的认识是：病例对照研究省下的时间与金钱，是以更高的偏倚警惕成本换来的，分析阶段无法弥补设计阶段埋下的系统误差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"现代变体与适用边界\">现代变体与适用边界</h2><p>病例对照研究衍生出几种提升效率与可信度的变体。病例交叉研究（case-crossover）让病例自己当自己的对照，比较发病前后的暴露差异，天然消除了所有不随时间变化的个体混杂，特别适合研究急性触发因素（如剧烈运动与心梗）。巢式病例对照研究（见 <a href=\"cohort-studies\">队列研究</a>）在既有队列内部抽对照，兼得队列的时序性与病例对照的成本优势。这些变体大多是为修补经典设计的偏倚弱点而生。</p>\n<p>把它放回设计谱系：当结局罕见、需要快速廉价地探索多种可能病因、或暴露资料难以前瞻采集时，病例对照研究是首选。但它无法直接给出发病率与绝对风险，对偏倚敏感，证据等级低于 <a href=\"cohort-studies\">队列研究</a>。一个成熟的研究者会把病例对照当作「假设生成与初筛」的高效工具，而把因果定论留给设计更严谨、偏倚更可控的研究——这也是 <a href=\"../applications/surveillance-evidence\">监测与循证决策</a> 中证据分级把它置于队列之下的理由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>病例对照研究「按结局分组、回顾暴露」，逆时间方向，适合罕见结局与快速廉价的病因初筛。</li>\n<li>无法直接算发病率，用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR = ad/bc</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 度量关联；仅在罕见病假设下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 才趋近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，否则高估。</li>\n<li>对照必须代表产生病例的源人群；匹配可控混杂但损失被匹配因素的研究能力，且需配对分析。</li>\n<li>回忆偏倚与选择偏倚是高发陷阱，须靠客观记录、设盲、合理对照来源在设计阶段防范。</li>\n<li>病例交叉、巢式病例对照是修补偏倚的现代变体；其证据等级低于队列，宜作假设生成而非因果定论。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"病例对照研究","id":"病例对照研究"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"比值比：为何能逼近相对危险度","id":"比值比-为何能逼近相对危险度"},{"level":2,"text":"对照选择：最难也最关键的一步","id":"对照选择-最难也最关键的一步"},{"level":2,"text":"偏倚的高发地带","id":"偏倚的高发地带"},{"level":2,"text":"现代变体与适用边界","id":"现代变体与适用边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"队列研究","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/study-design/cohort-studies"},"next":{"title":"横断面与生态研究","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/study-design/cross-sectional-ecological"}}